@@ -48,3 +48,46 @@ signal until the guest next polls, invokes the registered guest handler, and
 restores the CPU registers. The game handler reaps the compiler and records its
 exit status. Process completion also invalidates parent overlay lookups after
 external writes.
+
+## Custom map compiler hook
+
+If `~/Library/Application Support/Portal 2 Natif/map-compiler-hook` exists and
+is executable, the app launcher exports `P2_MAP_COMPILER` to it and
+`P2_NATIVE_MAP_COMPILER` to the bundled `portal2-map-compiler`. The hook
+receives the native compiler's arguments (`--images ... --program P -- <tool
+arguments>`) and decides what to run. Without the file, nothing changes.
+
+Plain relative search paths in `portal2/gameinfo.txt` (such as `Game "BEE2"`)
+resolve from the executable's directory, which is `bin/` here, not the game
+root. `tools/puzzlemaker.py` rewrites them to `|gameinfo_path|../NAME` in the
+user-data copy when a folder of that name exists in the game root.
+
+## BEEmod
+
+BEEmod (BEE2.4) 4.36 is the last release with a macOS build (Intel, runs under
+Rosetta). With `tools/beemod_map_compiler_hook.sh` installed as the hook above,
+Build and Play and publishing work with BEEmod items:
+
+1. Download `BEE2_4.36.0_mac_old.zip` and `BEE2_v4.36.0_packages_old.zip` from
+   the BEEmod releases and unzip both into one folder; `chmod +x` `BEE2`,
+   `compiler/vbsp_osx` and `compiler/vrad_osx`.
+2. Its Tk 8.6.8 draws empty windows on current macOS, and Tk 8.6.16 loops in
+   `update` while the window is built. Tk 8.6.10 works: from the python.org
+   `python-3.9.1-macos11.0.pkg` (expanded with `pkgutil --expand-full`, not
+   installed), take the x86_64 slices of `libtcl8.6.dylib` and
+   `libtk8.6.dylib` (`lipo -thin x86_64`, `install_name_tool -id
+   @loader_path/...`, `codesign -s -`), and replace BEEmod's `tcl/` and `tk/`
+   with `tcl8.6/` and `tk8.6/`; also copy `tcl8/` next to them (msgcat, needed
+   when started from Finder).
+3. Its game picker only accepts `.exe` files: write
+   `~/Library/Preferences/BEEMOD2/config/games.cfg` by hand, with
+   `SteamID = 620` and `Dir =` the Steam `Portal 2` folder.
+4. Quit the game, export from BEEmod, start Portal 2 Natif.
+
+The hook runs BEEmod's `bin/vbsp_osx` and `bin/vrad_osx`, which call back
+`bin/vbsp_osx_original` and `vrad_osx_original`: symlinks to the hook, which
+runs the native compiler. It translates the map path between the game folder
+and the user-data layer, and links `portal2/puzzles` and `portal2/screenshots`
+to user data for BEEmod's VRAD. Log: `~/Library/Logs/Portal2Natif-compiler.log`.
+BEEmod writes into the Steam folder: "Verify integrity of game files" undoes
+its export.
